1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,900
Hello, I am Opportunity.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,500
A rover built by NASA's engineers.

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,800
I reached Mars in 2004,

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,300
and my mission was supposed to last about three months.

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,900
But I still had so much left to explore.

6
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:16,100
I kept working for more than 14 years,

7
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,800
and I drove more than 45 kilometers.

8
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:22,400
In the rocks I found evidence that Mars once had water.

9
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,700
Until, in 2018,

10
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,900
a massive dust storm blocked the Sun,

11
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,400
and I could no longer charge my battery.

12
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,900
And that was the end of my journey.

13
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,000
I am still there, amid the quiet and the dust,

14
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:41,400
and I hope that when you look at Mars, you remember that one day I was exploring it for you.
